WEBVTT

00:00:28.359 --> 00:00:31.385
and they got on a boat
and they got to America.

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:36.179
Ellie said that when she heard
the stories of the teens

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:38.599
walking up across Mexico,

00:00:38.623 --> 00:00:43.224
all she could think about
was her grandfather and his brother.

00:00:43.248 --> 00:00:46.936
She said that for her, the stories
were exactly the same.

00:00:47.841 --> 00:00:51.432
Those brothers were
the Hassenfeld Brothers --

00:00:51.456 --> 00:00:53.360
the "Has" "bros" --

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:56.769
the Hasbro toy company,

00:00:56.793 --> 00:00:59.944
which, of course, brought us
Mr. Potato Head.